   Welcome to \033[34me1LibreOS 1.0 (Libre)\033[0m!

   A minimal, freedom-first Linux distro inspired by Fedora.
   Package manager: e1pkg (dnf-style).  Try:
       e1pkg search fetch
       e1pkg install e1fetch
       e1fetch
       e1pkg list installed

   This is a Live system running entirely in RAM.
   GUI workstation: install with setup-e1os --profile workstation.
   (Note: the VGA text console cannot render CJK; Chinese is fully
    displayed in the e1wm graphical desktop on the workstation.)
